This package validates EORI numbers against the European Commission's official
EORI validation web service (EOS), part of the Taxation and Customs Union DDS2
system. Opendpp UAB is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, the European
Commission. The service is provided by the European Commission under its own
terms; this package merely formats requests to, and parses responses from, that
service. See https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/dds2/eos/eori_validation.jsp

